                    "fillOpacity": 1
                  }
                ],
                "fontFamily": "Arimo",
                "text": "- Every other state keeps its meter colour at the top and falls to half of it at the foot: recording and overdubbing #FF1744 to #800C22, stopped and muted #FFFFFF to #808080, the armed empty track #6E6E73 to #37373A."
              }
